  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Create Environmental Clubs in  Ugandan Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will plant more seed beds to increase the planting of more trees in Uganda and create school environmental clubs to ensure students plant trees every Monday in a one-student one-tree campaign. Over 10,000 trees will be planted in the seed beds in 10 Schools and 6 villages.    The 10 clubs established in schools and MULIA youth-led club will manage and distribute the trees to communities where they come from and give assembly lectures on the importance of planting more trees.</narrative>
  </description>
